{"steam_appid":2612690,"steam_name":"Roots Devour","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2612690/436510298/22e9b6503c9fc0f1d42028e4ed42c54013d872d5/1767761735/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767763045","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257259091/5fb41b7558481eb052fdb1238fdefec38dc2f4a1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767763045","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/e6b4f03b3e92ab8e88ab3e85180d65ffefbe1903/ss_e6b4f03b3e92ab8e88ab3e85180d65ffefbe1903.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778216854","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/d937c723fc772af80b3b3eba5663a2c9da8ce98f/ss_d937c723fc772af80b3b3eba5663a2c9da8ce98f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778216854","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/1937291ba47a02a4d55a407a0cb09c9107c531e3/ss_1937291ba47a02a4d55a407a0cb09c9107c531e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778216854","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/cf7f6d6afd1dc7bed9acec8e69890c83f70b2edd/ss_cf7f6d6afd1dc7bed9acec8e69890c83f70b2edd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778216854","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/748dd5b61e481f2109ae22fbff3ec7e4d2d941bc/ss_748dd5b61e481f2109ae22fbff3ec7e4d2d941bc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778216854"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/2640e7325003abb98c62cb2df543b19a.avif?t=1778216854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras_big/2640e7325003abb98c62cb2df543b19a.avif?t=1778216854 width=1560 height=558 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roots Devour is a strategic exploration game centered around a card-connecting mechanism.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/c50b3b8e31c792a28044ef13771b14c3.webp?t=1778216854\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deep within the silent forest, roots stir slowly into consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A primal ravenousness takes instant command of your mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extend your roots—pierce, entwine,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And devour the blood of those creatures thrashing in terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Connect, and connect again—  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This frantic spread will not be halted.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Until the world is dismantled, reconstructed, and utterly swallowed by you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>All living things are nutrients; YOU are the only predator.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.poster.avif?t=1778216854\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.webm?t=1778216854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.mp4?t=1778216854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6e1f032191ebfe8d5b9a3a8d6184fef0.webp?t=1778216854\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cards are not tools,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the fragments and extensions of your will;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Paths are not choices,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">but corridors the world is compelled to surrender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the cost of every irrevocable bond,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Emerging from the dim-lit woods, traversing swamp and snow, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Usurping even upon the realms of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once the darkness is fully seized, you shall no longer require understanding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.poster.avif?t=1778216854\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.webm?t=1778216854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.mp4?t=1778216854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/04900afa4acb3c596deed858c42b2063.webp?t=1778216854\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cross paths with 'humans' burdened by their own secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As their superior, command their fates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Interfere, manipulate, or bend them to your will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your choices will pave the path of destiny, guiding the world to different fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For you… is this slaughter,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">or an act of mercy? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.poster.avif?t=1778216854\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.webm?t=1778216854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.mp4?t=1778216854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**Game Features**</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a silent, eerie, Lovecraftian forest, embody an ancient god driven by an insatiable thirst for blood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a card-connecting mechanism. With hundreds of cards at your disposal, craft shifting combinations and discover endless playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four distinct regions. Balance resource management, deck-building, puzzles, and card collection to overcome ever-evolving threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse cast of humans. Choose to remain a silent observer or intervene in their lives. Build bonds with up to 7 key characters to unlock hidden stories and multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/790614c92d3ae4d9b71eb0b62b5eb69d.poster.avif?t=1778216854\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/790614c92d3ae4d9b71eb0b62b5eb69d.webm?t=1778216854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 280x768 minimum resolution, DirectX 9.0c compatible graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Rewinding Games"],"publishers":["GCORES PUBLISHING"],"release_date":"27 Jan, 2026"}